WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.003 --> 00:00:02.502
♪ ♪

00:00:02.504 --> 00:00:02.732
♪ ♪

00:00:02.766 --> 00:00:04.310
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WELCOME BACK TO THE

00:00:04.344 --> 00:00:04.995
SPECIAL EDITION OF

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:05.783
"TUCKER CARLSON TONIGHT."

00:00:05.784 --> 00:00:07.682
THROUGHOUT THE LENGTH OF THIS

00:00:07.683 --> 00:00:09.422
PANDEMIC, WE CHECKED IN

00:00:09.457 --> 00:00:12.262
REGULARLY WITH DAVE PORTNOY DID

00:00:12.264 --> 00:00:14.805
ABOUT HOW HE IS HOLDING UP

00:00:14.839 --> 00:00:16.178
DURING THE LOCKDOWN.

00:00:16.179 --> 00:00:18.050
RECENTLY HE HAD HIS OWN SCARE

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:18.854
WITH THE CORONAVIRUS.

00:00:18.855 --> 00:00:20.988
HE JOINS US NOT TO DISCUSS HIS

00:00:20.989 --> 00:00:22.262
TIME IN LOCKDOWN AND WHAT HE HAS

00:00:22.297 --> 00:00:22.586
LEARNED.

00:00:22.587 --> 00:00:23.790
I THANK YOU FOR JOINING US

00:00:23.824 --> 00:00:24.320
TONIGHT.

00:00:24.322 --> 00:00:27.437
SO, FIRST I HAVE TO ASK YOU

00:00:27.471 --> 00:00:28.955
ABOUT THE EXPENDED PERIOD YOU

00:00:28.956 --> 00:00:30.007
SPEND IN BED SICK.

00:00:30.008 --> 00:00:31.535
DID YOU HAVE THE VIRUS?

00:00:31.569 --> 00:00:34.337
&gt;&gt; YEAH, SO I DID.

00:00:34.339 --> 00:00:35.854
I TESTED POSITIVE.

00:00:35.855 --> 00:00:37.666
AS WE ARE FILMING THIS RIGHT

00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:38.784
NOW, I JUST ENDED MY QUARANTINE

00:00:38.819 --> 00:00:40.747
TWO DAYS AGO.

00:00:40.781 --> 00:00:43.091
I WAS INSIDE FOR TWO STRAIGHT

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:44.101
WEEKS, 14 DAYS.

00:00:44.136 --> 00:00:45.275
WHEN I MADE THE ORIGINAL VIDEO

00:00:45.277 --> 00:00:47.522
SAYING I FELT SICK, I DIDN’T

00:00:47.556 --> 00:00:49.315
KNOW I HAD IT.

00:00:49.316 --> 00:00:51.060
I THINK I’VE HAD IT LIKE EIGHT

00:00:51.061 --> 00:00:51.291
TIMES.

00:00:51.292 --> 00:00:52.178
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHERE DID YOU GET

00:00:52.213 --> 00:00:53.300
IT?

00:00:53.301 --> 00:00:54.225
YOU KNOW?

00:00:54.226 --> 00:00:55.102
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:00:55.104 --> 00:01:00.110
I WAS IN THE HAMPTONS AND I WAS

00:01:00.111 --> 00:01:01.596
ACTUALLY WITH THE GROUP.

00:01:01.597 --> 00:01:03.522
LIKE SIX OR SEVEN OF US ALL

00:01:03.523 --> 00:01:03.993
TESTED POSITIVE.

00:01:04.028 --> 00:01:04.629
WE WERE STAYING TOGETHER.

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:07.423
I WOULD LOVE TO KNOW WHO GAVE IT

00:01:07.424 --> 00:01:08.151
TO ME.

00:01:08.185 --> 00:01:09.241
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YOU WERE STAYING

00:01:09.242 --> 00:01:11.573
WITH SIX OR SEVEN PEOPLE AT ONCE

00:01:11.607 --> 00:01:12.487
IN THE HAMPTONS.

00:01:12.522 --> 00:01:14.076
I DON’T FEEL LIKE I SHOULD ASK A

00:01:14.111 --> 00:01:15.694
FOLLOW-UP QUESTION THERE.

00:01:15.728 --> 00:01:18.225
I AM GLAD YOU ARE OKAY.

00:01:18.259 --> 00:01:19.551
&gt;&gt; IT’S A FIVE BEDROOM

00:01:19.552 --> 00:01:19.742
APARTMENT.

00:01:19.776 --> 00:01:22.034
IT WASN’T LIKE WE WERE ALL

00:01:22.035 --> 00:01:22.871
CRAMMED TOGETHER.

00:01:22.872 --> 00:01:24.428
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHAT HAVE YOU

00:01:24.463 --> 00:01:25.817
LEARNED FROM THE WHOLE

00:01:25.818 --> 00:01:26.210
EXPERIENCE?

00:01:26.211 --> 00:01:27.953
WE HAVE BEEN TALKING ABOUT THIS

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:29.135
VIRUS FOR MONTHS.

00:01:29.136 --> 00:01:30.639
YOU ACTUALLY GOT IT.

00:01:30.641 --> 00:01:31.849
WHAT DID YOU LEARN?

00:01:31.884 --> 00:01:34.414
&gt;&gt; I DIDN’T LEARN ANYTHING

00:01:34.448 --> 00:01:35.924
DIFFERENT THAN WHAT I THOUGHT.

00:01:35.958 --> 00:01:38.618
I WAS VERY TIRED, EXHAUSTED FOR

00:01:38.652 --> 00:01:39.577
TWO DAYS.

00:01:39.578 --> 00:01:40.860
WITHIN THE GROUP OF US,

00:01:40.861 --> 00:01:44.398
EVERYBODY WAS AFFECTED A LITTLE

00:01:44.399 --> 00:01:45.068
BIT DIFFERENTLY.

00:01:45.069 --> 00:01:47.049
BUT IT WAS A FLUKE.

00:01:47.050 --> 00:01:50.019
IT WAS A COLD.

00:01:50.053 --> 00:01:52.606
I WAS THE OLDEST OF THE GROUP.

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:56.242
WE HAD EVERYONE FROM MID 20s

00:01:56.276 --> 00:01:57.688
TO MY AGE.

00:01:57.690 --> 00:01:59.377
SOME PEOPLE GOT SICK.

00:01:59.378 --> 00:02:01.230
SOME PEOPLE FELT BAD FOR A DAY.

00:02:01.231 --> 00:02:02.970
I WAS SICK FOR TWO DAYS AND

00:02:03.004 --> 00:02:03.799
EXHAUSTED FOR REALLY A WEEKEND

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:05.204
TO HAVE.

00:02:05.238 --> 00:02:08.446
BUT THE BOTTOM LINE, YOU DON’T

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:12.768
HAVE UNDERLYING SYMPTOMS IF YOU

00:02:12.769 --> 00:02:15.943
ARE NOT ALREADY ILL OR SUB SUB

00:02:15.944 --> 00:02:16.735
SUSCEPTIBLE.

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:22.087
YOU ARE GOING TO GET OVER IT.

00:02:22.121 --> 00:02:24.611
IT’S A REAL THING IF YOU ARE

00:02:24.646 --> 00:02:25.765
ELDERLY OR YOU ARE HEALTH

00:02:25.799 --> 00:02:26.161
IMPAIRED.

00:02:26.196 --> 00:02:28.777
I THINK IT IS A REAL CONCERN.

00:02:28.811 --> 00:02:31.818
BUT FOR 99% OF THE COUNTRY, IT

00:02:31.819 --> 00:02:34.367
ACTS LIKE THE FLU.

00:02:34.401 --> 00:02:35.631
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YEAH.

00:02:35.633 --> 00:02:38.007
YOU SAY THIS FIRST HAND.

00:02:38.042 --> 00:02:40.461
ONE OF THE REASONS I ADMIRE YOUR
RESPONSE TO THE LOCKDOWN EVEN

00:02:40.496 --> 00:02:41.883
RESPONSE TO THE LOCKDOWN EVEN

00:02:41.917 --> 00:02:46.858
THOUGH YOU WERE SHOT OFF IN A

00:02:46.892 --> 00:02:47.419
APARTMENT.

00:02:47.454 --> 00:02:49.520
YOU ARE MEGA MOBILE THANKS TO

00:02:49.555 --> 00:02:50.115
ONLINE TRADING.

00:02:50.149 --> 00:02:52.335
HOW MUCH RICHER DID YOU GET

00:02:52.369 --> 00:02:53.670
DURING THE CORONAVIRUS LOCKDOWN?

00:02:53.671 --> 00:02:57.387
&gt;&gt; I DON’T LIKE TO TALK ABOUT

00:02:57.388 --> 00:03:01.903
MONEY, BUT MY NET WORTH IS

00:03:01.904 --> 00:03:03.981
PROBABLY, THE STOCK MARKET, I

00:03:03.982 --> 00:03:05.198
WAS NEVER A STOCKMARKET GUIDE

00:03:05.199 --> 00:03:06.544
GUIDE.

00:03:06.578 --> 00:03:07.616
NEVER TRADED.

00:03:07.617 --> 00:03:10.739
I ALWAYS LOOKED AT FINANCE GUYS

00:03:10.773 --> 00:03:15.012
LIKE THEY WERE PULLING IT ON ME.

00:03:15.013 --> 00:03:17.647
IT SEEMS TO GO UP LIKE 10%.

00:03:17.648 --> 00:03:18.589
600 GRAND TODAY TRADING.

00:03:18.624 --> 00:03:20.954
LITERALLY TODAY.

00:03:20.955 --> 00:03:22.064
IT’S BEAUTIFUL.

00:03:22.098 --> 00:03:24.158
I DON’T KNOW WHY ANYONE HAS A

00:03:24.159 --> 00:03:24.524
JOB.

00:03:24.526 --> 00:03:27.618
ALL YOU’VE GOT TO DO IS BUY

00:03:27.619 --> 00:03:29.328
STOCKS AND WATCH THEM GO UP.

00:03:29.363 --> 00:03:31.774
I DIDN’T KNOW THAT WOULD BE THE

00:03:31.775 --> 00:03:32.987
CASE BUT IT HAS BEEN.

00:03:33.021 --> 00:03:34.367
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BUT DOESN’T IT MAKE

00:03:34.369 --> 00:03:35.752
YOU A LITTLE NERVOUS?

00:03:35.753 --> 00:03:36.840
YOU ARE SITTING IN YOUR

00:03:36.874 --> 00:03:37.656
APARTMENT.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.498
YOU MAKE 600 GRAND.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.940
AREN’T YOU TEMPTED TO CASH OUT

00:03:41.941 --> 00:03:44.879
AND BUY A BIGGER PLACE?

00:03:44.913 --> 00:03:47.110
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, I AM ALWAYS

00:03:47.144 --> 00:03:47.539
TEMPTED.

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:50.192
BUT THE NATURE OF MY

00:03:50.226 --> 00:03:51.444
PERSONALITY, I LIKE PUSHING

00:03:51.478 --> 00:03:52.300
THINGS.

00:03:52.301 --> 00:03:56.839
IF I WASN’T SOMEBODY WHO ALWAYS
WANTED TO BUILD MORE AND

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.876
WANTED TO BUILD MORE AND

00:03:58.877 --> 00:04:00.914
ACCUMULATED MORE.

00:04:00.915 --> 00:04:05.143
YOU DON’T GET MEGA YACHTS WITH

00:04:05.144 --> 00:04:07.776
600 GRAND.

00:04:07.777 --> 00:04:09.865
&gt;&gt; Tucker: [LAUGHS]

00:04:09.866 --> 00:04:12.162
I ASKED YOU WHAT YOU HAVE

00:04:12.164 --> 00:04:12.648
LEARNED.

00:04:12.649 --> 00:04:15.710
YOU TAUGHT THE REST OF US HOW WE

00:04:15.711 --> 00:04:19.571
SHOULD HAVE SPENT THE LAST FOUR

00:04:19.605 --> 00:04:20.853
MONTHS.

00:04:20.854 --> 00:04:24.210
&gt;&gt; WE ARE A CAPITALIST SOCIETY.

00:04:24.244 --> 00:04:26.635
HOPEFULLY ONE DAY I CAN GET BACK

